
@TheAbstraction.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5152
@roleId = ""

### 1. GET - Lấy danh sách Role
GET {{TheAbstraction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/role/get
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. GET - Lấy Role theo ID
# GET {{TheAbstraction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/role/get/{{roleId}}
# Accept: application/json

###

### 3. POST - Tạo Role
POST {{TheAbstraction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/role/create
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "roleName": "Admin"
}
###

### 4. PUT - Cập nhật Role
PUT {{TheAbstraction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/role/edit
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
{
    "roleId": "{{roleId}}",
    "roleName": "Management"
}

###

### 5. DELETE - Xóa Role
DELETE {{TheAbstraction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/role/delete
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "roleId": "{{roleId}}"
}

###
